# Xcode build products and derived data. `install-on-device.sh` and the build
# commands write these here rather than into ~/Library, so they must not be
# committed — they are hundreds of megabytes and rebuild from source.
build/
build-*/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/

# xcodegen writes the project from project.yml, which stays the source of
# truth — but the generated project is committed all the same. Xcode Cloud
# clones this repository and opens the project directly; it does not run
# xcodegen, so a project that only exists after generation is a project it can
# never build. Regenerate with `xcodegen generate` and commit the result.
Florin.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
Florin.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
